# Media has to be same-origin with the app for the service worker to intercept
# it cleanly (DEPLOY.md §4). These two lines route it to the API, and they must
# stay ABOVE the SPA fallback: `/*` swallows everything after it, so an image
# request would otherwise receive index.html with a 200, which is a decode
# failure the browser reports as a broken picture.
#
# The API host is deployment-specific: change it if you are not app.ragbag.app.

/api/media/*              https://api.ragbag.app/api/media/:splat  200
/api/blobs/download-urls  https://api.ragbag.app/api/blobs/download-urls  200

/*  /index.html  200
